<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #2e8b57;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 200px;
            height: auto;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <a href="{{FRONTEND_URL}}">
                <img src="{{logoBase64}}" alt="VapeHub Logo" class="logo" />
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Account Deletion Confirmation</h2>
            <p>Dear Customer,</p>
            <p>
                This email confirms that your VapeHub account has been successfully deleted. We're sorry to see you go, but we respect your decision.
            </p>

            <p>
                If you did not request this account deletion, please contact our support team immediately at support@vapehub.com.
            </p>

            <p>
                Please note that all your personal data has been permanently removed from our systems in accordance with our privacy policy.
            </p>

            <p>
                If you change your mind in the future, you're always welcome to create a new account with us.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} VapeHub. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Thank you for being a part of our community.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 